      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "text": "aleph-api  (FastAPI + Pydantic)\n\u2022 Typed services \u2022 Auth + project-scoping middleware\n\u2022 Wiki retrieval router (page-selector LLM call) \u2190 the primary path\n\u2022 Action-ledger writer (hash-chained)  \u2022 Cost-ledger writer\n\u2022 A2UI Python SDK  \u2022 Langfuse + OTEL trace context\n\u2022 AIQ client (service token, async jobs, SSE consumer)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "aleph-api  (FastAPI + Pydantic)\n\u2022 Typed services \u2022 Auth + project-scoping middleware\n\u2022 Wiki retrieval router (page-selector LLM call) \u2190 the primary path\n\u2022 Action-ledger writer (hash-chained)  \u2022 Cost-ledger writer\n\u2022 A2UI Python SDK  \u2022 Langfuse + OTEL trace context\n\u2022 AIQ client (service token, async jobs, SSE consumer)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    },
