      "text": "aleph-workers\n\u2022 Wiki agent (ingest, compile,\n  index, alias extraction,\n  SourcePage maintenance,\n  synthesis drafts)\n\u2022 MechanicalReviewer\n\u2022 EditorialReviewer (DeepAgents)\n\u2022 Builder\n\u2022 Normalization\n\u2022 Intra-source chunk + embed\n\u2022 Playwright render",
