      "text": "aiq-server  (NeMo Agent Toolkit)\n\u2022 Orchestrator  \u2022 ShallowResearcher\n\u2022 DeepResearcher  \u2022 Clarifier\n\u2022 data_source_registry (connectors)\n\u2022 tokenomics \u2192 CostLedger adapter\n\u2022 citation_verification \u2192 MechReviewer\n\u2022 Custom LangChain middleware\n\nAll LLM calls via LiteLLM gateway\n(_type: openai, base_url=LITELLM_BASE_URL).\nOutput = synthesis proposal, never wiki write.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 13,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "aiq-server  (NeMo Agent Toolkit)\n\u2022 Orchestrator  \u2022 ShallowResearcher\n\u2022 DeepResearcher  \u2022 Clarifier\n\u2022 data_source_registry (connectors)\n\u2022 tokenomics \u2192 CostLedger adapter\n\u2022 citation_verification \u2192 MechReviewer\n\u2022 Custom LangChain middleware\n\nAll LLM calls via LiteLLM gateway\n(_type: openai, base_url=LITELLM_BASE_URL).\nOutput = synthesis proposal, never wiki write.",
